# NOTE 2026-09-26T16:53:15+08:00: SUPERSEDED. This file (and zka_gk_exec_v1_before_fix.csv) holds the rows of the pre-fix build (gk sources 69e66f324437, aggr_gk ELF e34f62c6...). That build (a) let COMPRESS merge t_0 away, so per-epoch summaries could lose the minimum (60 of 64 AOL epochs) and low-phi quantiles could exceed eps n, and (b) bounded the k-way union quantile under any tie order, so its certificate could exceed eps N. Both fixed; current rows are in zka_gk_exec.csv/.log. The row labelled proved_contended in the CSV was relabelled by hand (disclosed in the NOTE above); the fixed driver labels contention itself.
